Author: Zachary Canann <zacharycanann@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 19 09:24:01 2026 -0700

    psi: preserve exact custody through value qualification
    
    Qualification follows the selected normalized domain atoms rather than unrelated issuer domains on a linear carrier. Core Vacant and Resident now name explicit protected transfer routes; these declarations do not implement initialization or provide backing.
    
    A representation-preserving qualification consumes the operand's exact claim across places, calls, projections and checked target families. Nested qualifications consume the completed child's exact membership. Partial moves retain unselected siblings, and unselected target bodies still discharge their promises.
    
    Nine authored places and eleven runtime fixtures execute with native and Terminal exit 0 on macOS ARM64. Eighteen source controls reject missing issuance, moved-value reuse, resident-index substitution and checked-adapter custody forgery. Six neighboring runtime outcomes match d012ed8f, including its existing unsupported Terminal host binding. Scoped Clippy completes with existing warnings; warnings-as-errors is not clean. The actual-backed initialization and retirement lifecycle remains unfinished.

